  "published": "2026-10-23T19:42:47.133Z",
  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog 0.1.25\n\n## Changes since v0.1.0\n\n- Document supported platforms in the README (#17) (`6d4a9ed`)\n- Ship only desktop platform native assets in the tool package (#16) (`dc17318`)\n- Share a single headless Avalonia session across the test assembly (#14) (`7513d68`)\n- Move secondary toolbar actions into an overflow menu and let the toolbar wrap (#13) (`583884d`)\n- Add accessible names to icon-only buttons in the main window (#12) (`7b92e8c`)\n- Bind Ctrl+O to the open file command (#11) (`e106452`)\n- Fix status bar width format so selected element width is shown (#9) (`929071c`)\n- Fix inspect menu crash by integrating ReactiveUI with Avalonia and using EnhancedCommand (#8) (`df67f86`)\n- Move catalog gallery layout and scrolling to native shell outside previewer (`a07222c`)\n- Support preview of Gradients, Brushes, Typography specimens and StreamGeometry (`7a9dc22`)\n- Move resource catalog gallery to native application shell sidebar (`4d4ba09`)\n- Add automatic rich preview for Styles and ResourceDictionaries with flat and tree views (`cf93a33`)\n- feat: add right-click inspect context menu with visual tree hierarchy navigation (`cf42ad2`)\n- feat: resolve source XAML file for nested controls in visual inspection (`288a260`)\n- feat: marcar visualmente los controles bajo el puntero con Adorner en tiempo real (`d8567b4`)\n- fix: corregir orden de canales de color (RGBA vs BGRA) en el renderizado del previsualizador (`0c1b102`)\n- feat: inyectar Design.DataContext, fondo de tema y DataTemplates en la previsualización (`7bf65dc`)\n- fix: resolver ensamblados dependientes, behaviors y runtimeconfig al previsualizar soluciones complejas (`3cc7d5c`)\n- feat: Implement custom interactive preview host with live element inspection and XAML source mapping (`7e9000e`)\n- style: homogenizar altura a 30px y compactar tipografía en la barra de herramientas (`0f67a87`)\n- refactor: simplificar encuadre inicial usando ZoomBorder.AutoFit en lugar de manipular la ventana (`76d90b9`)\n- feat: autoajustar tamaño de ventana al contenido en carga inicial y compactar barra de herramientas (`c80c6b3`)\n- fix: normalizar URIs de archivo (file://) y corregir recurso de icono Avalonia (`0e16bc2`)\n- feat: Add desktop integration script for Linux and update README (`93e96b3`)\n- feat: Add package icon and Flaticon attribution to README and app (`5a34c21`)\n",
